# The Bow Master's headline node: a zone that rains arrows for as long as the
# storm stands, and a third again on every other thing they do.
#
# GMS lays the zone where the player is attacking, rains on it every 5 seconds
# for 2.5, and lets six of them stand at once so long as they do not overlap.
# Nothing here has a position, so the six zones are one rain and the trigger
# is dropped: this game's swing clock never idles while a monster stands, so
# "when you attack with your own skills" is every five seconds.
#
# Four rains a cycle, not one. A 40-second battle analysis counts 29 uses and
# 203 hits -- seven lines a rain exactly, and 32 rains is what eight cycles of
# four come to. The four fall 0.83 seconds apart inside GMS's 2.5, which is
# one moment here: a whole respawn beat is wider than the window they fall in.
#
# The rain grows with the crowd the SWING is on, never with its own reach.
# GMS says "if currently attacking more than one enemy", and a Bow Master
# bossing swings Hurricane at one part of eight -- read off the rain instead,
# Zakum and Horntail would take the fifteen-line pour meant for a farm.
#
# Magic Arrow's doubling is the arrowhead Enchanted Quiver equips, which this
# game already carries as that skill's Final Attack. Doubled it passes
# certainty: one arrow outright and a fifth of a second one. GMS words the
# clause against Quiver Cartridge, whose 30% doubled is exactly Enchanted
# Quiver's own 60% -- a sentence that would grant nothing to the only class
# that can cast this, so it is read as the rate doubling.
name: "Storm of Arrows"
description:
  "Arrows shot into the sky fall like rain. Unaffected by attack reflection."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ACTIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_BOW_MASTER_V skill_order: 1 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_JOB
max_level: 30
base_delay_ms: 120
cooldown_seconds: 120.0
buff {
  duration_seconds: 41.0
  duration_seconds_per_level: 1.0
  base { final_dmg_pct: 0.155 }
  per_level { final_dmg_pct: 0.005 }
  boost {
    skill_name: "Enchanted Quiver"
    final_attack_chance_mult: 2.0
  }
  pulse {
    label: "Arrow Rain"
    cast_interval_seconds: 5.0
    casts: 4
    max_enemies: 10
    lines: 7
    lines_per_extra_enemy: 2
    max_extra_lines: 8
    base { skill_pct: 7.80 }
    per_level { skill_pct: 0.30 }
  }
}
